\frametitle{Pokretanje baze i API-ja (danas)}
\begin{lstlisting}[language=bash]
# baza
docker compose up -d db

# backend
cd api
uv venv
source .venv/bin/activate
uv pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
\end{lstlisting}

\vspace{0.4em}
\texttt{uv} objedinjuje venv i pip, brži je i danas je standard za nove projekte - \codefile{requirements.txt} ostaje isti.

\vspace{0.4em}
Checkpoint: otvorite \texttt{http://127.0.0.1:8000/health} i dobijte \texttt{"ok"}.
